  title "Obscureth~ Carves What Must Be Forgotten"
  summary "Obscureth~, a Remembrancer carving memorial inscriptions in the frozen depths of Nightshelf, must record the death of Augur ☽'Silvsiaelrous~ the Resolute, a powerful augur of the Shadow Covens Order who died during the catastrophic Abyss Collapse Tide. The chronicle reveals that Silvsiaelrous~ discovered the Omega Obelisk—a mysterious whale-bone artifact from the deep sea—contained a dangerous force that threatened the Berg itself, and she descended into the collapse to contain it, though the obelisk continues to rise from the depths. Obscureth~ carefully carves the official memorial narrative demanded by the Fire Keepers while silently preserving the true, more complex story through the precision of her work, choosing what to record and what to leave as knowing silence."
